    {
      "id": "content_poea.67465771.js:318:991:1b0644633788",
      "file": "content_poea.67465771.js",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "context": "output[0]",
      "shouldTranslate": true,
      "shouldTranslated": true,
      "original": "Electing to have a little fun, you set a course for Poe A and before long, the planet looms before you on the display. It’s not particularly large, for a civilized world, but the traffic for landing vehicles is a little ridiculous. Thousands of craft are coming in every minute, with no sign of the influx slowing down. They’re from all over the galaxy too, even models you’ve never heard of before. Taking your place in the landing queue, you look around at some of the other visitors, eyes watering with envy as you spot a few ships that probably cost as much as this whole planet. Apparently the stories of stars slumming it up during the festival weren’t exaggerated!",
      "translation": "为了找点乐子，你设定航线前往坡A星。不久，这颗行星便出现在显示屏上。以一个文明世界而言，它并不算特别大，但等待降落的飞行器多得有些荒唐。每分钟都有数千艘飞船抵达，而且涌入的势头丝毫没有放缓。它们来自银河系各处，其中甚至有你从未见过的型号。你排进降落队列，环顾其他访客；当你看到几艘价值恐怕抵得上整颗行星的飞船时，羡慕得眼睛都发酸了。看来，那些关于明星们在节日期间跑来体验平民生活的传闻并没有夸大！",
      "start": 318,
      "end": 991,
      "line": 13,
      "raw": "\"Electing to have a little fun, you set a course for Poe A and before long, the planet looms before you on the display. It’s not particularly large, for a civilized world, but the traffic for landing vehicles is a little ridiculous. Thousands of craft are coming in every minute, with no sign of the influx slowing down. They’re from all over the galaxy too, even models you’ve never heard of before. Taking your place in the landing queue, you look around at some of the other visitors, eyes watering with envy as you spot a few ships that probably cost as much as this whole planet. Apparently the stories of stars slumming it up during the festival weren’t exaggerated!\"",
      "translationStatus": "manual_translated",
      "translationModel": "Manual",
      "translatedAt": "2026-10-23T18:12:15.951Z"
    },
