    {
      "id": "content_poea.67465771.js:2669:3011:c44936aaa164",
      "file": "content_poea.67465771.js",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "context": "output[0]",
      "shouldTranslate": true,
      "shouldTranslated": true,
      "original": "Recalling what you’ve read in the invitation letter, the parties held at this location may have a tendency to get way out of hand, <b>resulting in permanent consequences.</b> However there are other options as well: you got another email inviting you to some kind of House of Whorrors if you wanted to go there before heading to the Masque.",
      "translation": "想起邀请函里的内容，这里举行的派对似乎很容易彻底失控，<b>并造成永久性的后果。</b>不过，你还有别的选择：你又收到了一封邮件，邀请你在前往假面舞会之前先去某个名叫淫恐屋的地方。",
      "start": 2669,
      "end": 3011,
      "line": 53,
      "raw": "\"Recalling what you’ve read in the invitation letter, the parties held at this location may have a tendency to get way out of hand, <b>resulting in permanent consequences.</b> However there are other options as well: you got another email inviting you to some kind of House of Whorrors if you wanted to go there before heading to the Masque.\"",
      "translationStatus": "manual_translated",
      "translationModel": "Manual",
      "translatedAt": "2026-10-23T18:12:15.951Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "content_poea.67465771.js:3121:3349:1a1ee0d68e35",
      "file": "content_poea.67465771.js",
      "category": "dialogue",
      "context": "output[0]",
      "shouldTranslate": true,
      "shouldTranslated": true,
      "original": "\n\n(The Masque is intended to be experienced as a one-time event. <b>Revisiting this event is non-canon and will be treated as if you have been there for the very first time.</b> Keep that in mind and have a Happy Halloween!)",
      "translation": "\n\n(假面舞会被设计为一次性活动。<b>再次参加该活动不属于正史，系统会将其视为你第一次参加。</b>请记住这一点，祝你万圣节快乐！)",
      "start": 3121,
      "end": 3349,
      "line": 57,
      "raw": "\"\\n\\n(The Masque is intended to be experienced as a one-time event. <b>Revisiting this event is non-canon and will be treated as if you have been there for the very first time.</b> Keep that in mind and have a Happy Halloween!)\"",
